---
const pageTitle = 'Pamela Chia | Founder and engineer'
const pageDescription =
  'Pamela Chia is a founder and engineer working in growth engineering at Supabase.'
const canonicalUrl = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site)
const person = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Person',
  name: 'Pamela Chia',
  url: 'https://pamelachia.com',
  email: 'pamelachiamayyee@gmail.com',
  jobTitle: 'Growth Engineer',
  worksFor: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Supabase' },
  sameAs: [
    'https://github.com/pamelachia',
    'https://www.linkedin.com/in/pamela-chia/',
  ],
}
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1c1a19" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonicalUrl} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={pageDescription} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonicalUrl} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(person)}></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="top">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a>
    <main id="content" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="intro section" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="masthead">
          <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Pamela Chia, home">PC</a>
          <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
            <a href="#work">Work</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Founder and engineer</p>
          <h1 id="page-title">Pamela Chia</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            I do growth engineering at Supabase, working across product, data,
            and experiences for AI agents.
          </p>
          <p class="intro-detail">
            My foundation is in behavioural game theory, econometrics, and full-stack
            data systems. I am interested in the choices that turn an idea into
            something people can use, and the systems that keep it working.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-footer">
          <span>Based in Singapore</span>
          <a href="#work">Selected work</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">01 / Selected work</p>
          <h2 id="work-title">Making complex systems useful</h2>
        </div>

        <article class="work-item">
          <div class="work-number" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
          <div class="work-content">
            <h3>Full-stack growth systems across teams</h3>
            <p>
              I joined Supabase in 2023 and built across frontend, backend, data, and
              infrastructure. My work included event APIs and product analytics,
              lifecycle email and resource-usage notifications, consent management,
              and self-service compliance experiences, working with engineering,
              Legal, and customer-facing teams.
            </p>
            <p class="evidence-label">Public proof</p>
            <ul class="proof-links" aria-label="Public proof for cross-team growth systems">
              <li><a href="https://github.com/supabase/supabase/pull/15231">Dashboard telemetry API</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://github.com/supabase/supabase/pull/18307">Self-service compliance</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="work-item">
          <div class="work-number" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <div class="work-content">
            <h3>Extending growth to AI agents</h3>
            <p>
              More recently, I extended that work to agents: structured CLI output,
              discovery interfaces connecting documentation, APIs, and MCP endpoints,
              and measurement of how agents find and use the product.
            </p>
            <p>
              I also build agent-assisted engineering workflows, with response
              evaluation, explicit verification, and human decisions for production
              remediation.
            </p>
            <p class="evidence-label">Public proof</p>
            <ul class="proof-links" aria-label="Public proof for AI agent work">
              <li><a href="https://github.com/supabase/cli/pull/5532">Structured CLI output</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://github.com/supabase/supabase/pull/49768">Agent discovery catalog</a></li>
              <li><a href="https://github.com/supabase/supabase/pull/50180">API and MCP discovery</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="work-item">
          <div class="work-number" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
          <div class="work-content">
            <h3>Algorithms and mathematical modelling</h3>
            <p>
              At Vase, I built a balanced population sampling algorithm and worked on
              data pipelines, architecture, and internal products, progressing from
              analyst to engineer to lead. My economics research studied organisational
              incentives and technology adoption through behavioural game theory and
              agent-based modelling.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">02 / Background</p>
          <h2 id="about-title">Founder and engineer</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p>
              Before Supabase, I co-founded SISU Wellness and served as its CTO.
              I led product and engineering from concept through launch.
            </p>
            <p>
              I studied economics at Warwick, graduating with an MSc with Distinction.
              My dissertation, <em>More than Money: Motivated Agents, Organisation
              Goals, and Organisational Structure</em>, explored behavioural game
              theory. My undergraduate research, <em>The Way We Learn: A Game of
              Technology Adoption for Self-Tuning Agents</em>, used game theory and
              agent-based modelling.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="personal-note">
            <p class="eyebrow">Outside work</p>
            <p>
              I read widely, track personal experiments, and keep a second brain
              to connect ideas across books, projects, and everyday life.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 / Contact</p>
          <h2 id="contact-title">Get in touch</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-content">
          <p>I am always glad to meet people thinking seriously about what to build next.</p>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <a class="primary-link" href="mailto:pamelachiamayyee@gmail.com">Email</a>
            <a href="https://cv.pamelachia.com/">CV</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/pamelachia">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pamela-chia/">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Pamela Chia</span>
      <a href="#top">Back to top</a>
    </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { background: #1c1a19; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; color: #f3efe7; background: #1c1a19; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-decoration-color: #55c1f7; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  :global(a:hover) { color: #55c1f7; }
  :global(a:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid #55c1f7; outline-offset: 5px; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; z-index: 2; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; padding: .5rem .75rem; color: #1c1a19; background: #f3efe7; transform: translateY(-180%); }
  .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
  .section { width: min(100% - 3rem, 76rem); margin: 0 auto; padding: 8rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #5d5751; }
  .intro { display: flex; min-height: 100svh; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 0; }
  .masthead { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .76rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .wordmark { color: #55c1f7; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.03em; text-decoration: none; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 1.35rem; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; }
  .intro-copy { max-width: 60rem; padding: 6rem 0; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #55c1f7; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
  h1 { max-width: 12ch; margin-bottom: .3rem; font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 10rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.07em; line-height: .85; }
  .lede { max-width: 31ch; margin: 3rem 0 1.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.45rem); line-height: 1.2; }
  .intro-detail { max-width: 39rem; margin-bottom: 0; color: #c5beb5; }
  .intro-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #c5beb5; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .76rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .intro-footer a { color: #f3efe7; }
  .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 5rem; }
  .section-heading .eyebrow { margin: .5rem 0 0; }
  h2 { max-width: 11ch; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5.2rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: .96; }
  .work { padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  .work-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr; gap: 2rem; padding: 3.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #5d5751; }
  .work-number { color: #c5beb5; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .76rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .work-content { max-width: 43rem; }
  h3 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.08; }
  .work-content p { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; color: #ddd7cf; }
  .evidence-label { margin-top: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: .7rem !important; color: #55c1f7 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .proof-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem 1.2rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .88rem; list-style: none; }
  .proof-links a { color: #f3efe7; }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; }
  .about-copy { max-width: 42rem; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2.05rem); line-height: 1.25; }
  .about-copy p + p { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .personal-note { align-self: end; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #5d5751; color: #c5beb5; }
  .personal-note .eyebrow { margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .personal-note p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .contact-content { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .contact-content > p { max-width: 23rem; margin: 0; color: #c5beb5; }
  .contact-links { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .8rem; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2.05rem); }
  .contact-links a { text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
  .contact-links .primary-link { color: #55c1f7; }
  footer { display: flex; width: min(100% - 3rem, 76rem); justify-content: space-between; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #5d5751; color: #c5beb5; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    :global(body) { font-size: 17px; }
    .section { width: min(100% - 2rem, 76rem); padding: 5rem 0; }
    .intro { min-height: 44rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; }
    .intro-copy { padding: 5rem 0; }
    .section-heading, .work-item, .about-grid, .contact-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
    .section-heading { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .work-item { gap: .8rem; padding: 2.8rem 0; }
    .work-number { color: #55c1f7; }
    .proof-links { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .25rem; }
    .proof-links a, .contact-links a { display: block; min-height: 2.75rem; padding: .5rem 0; }
    .about-grid { gap: 3rem; }
    .about-copy { font-size: 1.45rem; }
    .contact-content { gap: 3rem; }
    .contact-links { gap: .25rem; }
    footer { width: min(100% - 2rem, 76rem); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 430px) {
    nav { gap: .9rem; }
    .intro-footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 18vw, 5.3rem); }
    .lede { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .6rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
</style>
